flowchart TD

    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始編輯商品操作)
    ClickEditButton(點擊編輯商品按鈕)
    PopUpEditProduct(彈出編輯商品視窗)
    LoadExistingProductInfo(載入現有商品資訊)
    UpdateProductInfo(填寫商品資訊)
    ClickConfirmButton(點擊確認按鈕)
    ClickCancelButton(點擊取消按鈕)
    RequestToEditProductAPI(發送編輯商品請求)
    IsSuccess{是否編輯成功}
    PopUpFailed(彈出編輯失敗視窗)
    ReserveInfo(保留商品資訊)
    RefreshTable(重新整理Table)
    EndPoint(編輯商品操作完成)

    StartPoint --> ClickEditButton
    ClickEditButton --> PopUpEditProduct
    PopUpEditProduct --> LoadExistingProductInfo
    LoadExistingProductInfo --> UpdateProductInfo
    UpdateProductInfo --> ClickConfirmButton
    ClickConfirmButton --> RequestToEditProductAPI
    RequestToEditProductAPI --> IsSuccess
    IsSuccess -->|是| RefreshTable
    IsSuccess -->|否| PopUpFailed
    PopUpFailed --> ReserveInfo
    ReserveInfo --> EndPoint
    RefreshTable --> EndPoint
    StartPoint --> ClickCancelButton
    ClickCancelButton --> EndPoint